    "b-30-smashwiki-corpus-this-document-defines-th-1": {
      "id": "b-30-smashwiki-corpus-this-document-defines-th-1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "This document defines the local SmashWiki mirror as a directly searched raw-text knowledge store. Reading it explains how the corpus is synchronized, what evidence and crosswalk data it supplies, and how workers access it without a separate extraction or index service."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-30-smashwiki-corpus-what-it-is-2": {
      "id": "b-30-smashwiki-corpus-what-it-is-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "What it is"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-30-smashwiki-corpus-a-local-mirror-of-smashw-3": {
      "id": "b-30-smashwiki-corpus-a-local-mirror-of-smashw-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "A local mirror of SmashWiki at "
        },
        {
          "insert": "games/melee/knowledge/sources/rag_search/smashwiki/",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " — roughly 1,600 pages with per-section retrieval, covering hitbox tables, frame data, and media. Corpus regime: raw text stored verbatim, nothing interpreted, so there is nothing to drift — only staleness versus upstream, which is tolerable."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-30-smashwiki-corpus-now-that-the-mirror-sits-4": {
      "id": "b-30-smashwiki-corpus-now-that-the-mirror-sits-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Now that the mirror sits among the knowledge stores, its input side is one upstream concern: the sync job refreshes the mirror from SmashWiki, and staleness versus upstream stays tolerable. There is no extraction pipeline to feed — the corpus is consumed by searching it."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-30-smashwiki-corpus-per-the-migration-map-de-5": {
      "id": "b-30-smashwiki-corpus-per-the-migration-map-de-5",
      "type": "quote",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Per the migration-map decision: nothing gets built for the smashwiki row. The corpus stays the file mirror searched by worker-side tooling — no server component, no index service. Raw text searched at need is the corpus regime working as designed."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
